{"id":"649541","name":"茄子拌猪舌头","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/649541/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"2根"},{"name":"熟猪舌头","amount":"125克"}],"sub":[{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：茄子、熟猪舌头（已切片）。","img":"images/649541/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将茄子去蒂清洗清洗，折成段。","img":"images/649541/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入蒸锅里。","img":"images/649541/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盖上盖，开锅蒸7到8分钟。","img":"images/649541/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"接着，开盖取出。","img":"images/649541/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入大碗中，晾凉。","img":"images/649541/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后，将晾凉好的茄子撕开。","img":"images/649541/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"最后，合入熟猪舌头，加适量的生抽。","img":"images/649541/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/649541/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/649541/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"调味拌匀即成。","img":"images/649541/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}